<title>HONG KONG: Orange users may exceed 1 mln in months-Li.</title>
<headline>Orange users may exceed 1 mln in months-Li.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchison Whampoa Ltd said on Wednesday its associate, British mobile phone operator Orange Plc, may have more than one million subscribers in the coming three to four months.</p>
<p>&quot;Maybe in the coming three to four months, it will have more than one million subscribers,&quot; Hutchison Chairman Li Ka-shing told a news conference.</p>
<p>Its subscriber base stands at about 888,000 at present, which is more than double that in the previous year, Li said in a statement issued on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
